---
module: todo
func_id: add-task
---

***conformance tests***

# add-first-task
Running `todo add Buy milk` on an empty list prints `Added task 1: Buy milk` and exits with status 0.

# add-without-name
Running `todo add` prints `Error: name is required` to stderr and exits with status 1.

***acceptance tests***

# add-then-list
Running `todo add Buy milk` and then `todo list` prints `1 Buy milk`.
